Introduction
This project simulates the financial and operational analytics of a global ride-hailing company. It focuses on analyzing ride revenue, driver payments, operational costs, customer demand, and profitability across different cities and regions.

Using SQL, Excel, Python, and Power BI, the project will develop automated reporting workflows, financial performance models, and interactive dashboards to monitor business KPIs, identify cost inefficiencies, forecast revenue, and evaluate operational performance.

The goal is to help management understand financial performance, improve operational efficiency, automate recurring reports, and make smarter business decisions.
